---
---
<!-- SECTION: CONNECTED DISCIPLINES & ASSENT-BASED PHILOSOPHY -->
<section id="services" class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-brand-berry">Connected Disciplines</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2">Transdisciplinary In-Home Care</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
        We break down the clinical silos. When we connect your family with an in-home therapy team, we integrate
        behavioural science with allied healthcare to support the whole child.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Service Card 1: ABA Core -->
      <div
        class="bg-brand-surface rounded-3xl p-8 border border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all"
      >
        <div>
          <div
            class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-orchid text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-glow-orchid mb-6"
          >
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">In-Home Applied Behaviour Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Instructor Therapists work 1-on-1 inside your home under the direct oversight of a Registered Behaviour
            Analyst. We teach meaningful communication, functional daily skills, and assent-based emotional regulation.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orchid"></span>Functional Communication Training (FCT)
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orchid"></span>Toileting, dressing & self-help routines
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orchid"></span>Assent-based reduction of distress
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-prefill-goal="In-Home ABA Therapy"
          class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-brand-orchid text-brand-orchid text-xs font-bold hover:bg-brand-orchid hover:text-white transition-all"
        >
          Request ABA Team Match
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Service Card 2: Allied Health Coordination -->
      <div
        class="bg-brand-surface rounded-3xl p-8 border border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all"
      >
        <div>
          <div
            class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-ocean text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-glow-ocean mb-6"
          >
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Speech & Occupational Collaboration</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            We bridge your child's in-home ABA sessions with external Speech-Language Pathologists (SLPs) and
            Occupational Therapists (OTs). AAC setups, fine-motor tasks, and sensory profiles are unified.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-ocean"></span>TouchChat, Proloquo2Go & PECS alignment
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-ocean"></span>Sensory diet integration into ABA sessions
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-ocean"></span>Unified caregiver coaching protocols
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-prefill-goal="Speech & OT Collaboration"
          class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-brand-ocean text-brand-ocean text-xs font-bold hover:bg-brand-ocean hover:text-white transition-all"
        >
          Request Allied Connection
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Service Card 3: Neurodiversity-Affirming Standard -->
      <div
        class="bg-brand-surface rounded-3xl p-8 border border-brand-border flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all"
      >
        <div>
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-berry text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-md mb-6">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Assent-Based & Trauma-Informed</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Every therapy team on our network adheres to contemporary neurodiversity-affirming standards. We prioritize
            autonomy, self-advocacy, and emotional safety over forced compliance or mask-forcing.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-berry"></span>Zero forced eye-contact or stim-suppression
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-berry"></span>Continuous verbal & non-verbal assent checks
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-berry"></span>Respect for autistic sensory preferences
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-prefill-goal="Assent-Based Care"
          class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-brand-berry text-brand-berry text-xs font-bold hover:bg-brand-berry hover:text-white transition-all"
        >
          Connect with Affirming Teams
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
